{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-3-1","title":"Jeremiah 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God's great mercy in Judah's vile whoredom. 6 Judah is worse than Israel. 12 The promises of the gospel to the penitent. 20 Israel reproved, and called by God, makes a solemn confession of their sins.</p>\n<p>They say. Heb. Saying. If a man. De 24:1-4 shall not that. 9; 2:7; Le 18:24-28; Isa 24:5; Mic 2:10 but thou hast. 2:20,23; De 22:21; Jud 19:2; Eze 16:26,28,29; 23:4-49 Ho 1:2; 2:5-7 yet return. 12-14,22; 4:1,14; 8:4-6; De 4:29-31; Isa 55:6-9; Eze 33:11 Ho 14:1-4; Zec 1:3; Lu 15:16-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-2","title":"Jeremiah 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Lift. 2:23; Eze 8:4-6; Lu 16:23 unto. 2:20; De 12:2; 1Ki 11:3; 2Ki 23:13; Eze 16:16,24,25; 20:28 In the. Ge 38:14; Pr 7:11; 23:28; Eze 16:24,25 thou hast. 1,9; 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-3","title":"Jeremiah 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the showers. 9:12; 14:4,22; Le 26:19; De 28:23; Isa 5:6; Joe 1:16-20; Am 4:7 Hag 1:11 latter rain. 5:24 a whore's. 5:3; 6:15; 8:12; 44:16,17; Eze 3:7; 16:30-34; Zep 3:5 thou refusedst. 5:3; Ne 9:17; Zec 7:11,12; Heb 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-4","title":"Jeremiah 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Wilt thou. 19; 31:9,18-20; Ho 14:1-3 My father. 2:27 the guide. 2:2; Ps 48:14; 71:5,17; 119:9; Pr 1:4; 2:17; Ho 2:15; Mal 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-5","title":"Jeremiah 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>he reserve. 12; Ps 77:7-9; 85:5; 103:8,9; Isa 57:16; 64:9 thou hast spoken. Eze 22:6; Mic 2:1; 7:3; Zep 3:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-6","title":"Jeremiah 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>A.M. 3292. B.C. 612. backsliding. 8,11-14; 2:19; 7:24; 2Ki 17:7-17; Eze 23:11 she is. 2:20; Isa 57:7; Eze 16:24,25,31; 20:28; 1Ki 14:23 played. 1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-7","title":"Jeremiah 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Turn thou. 2Ki 17:13,14; 2Ch 30:6-12; Ho 6:1-4; 14:1 her treacherous. 8-11; Eze 16:46; 23:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-8","title":"Jeremiah 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>when for. 1; 2Ki 17:6-18; 18:9-11; Eze 23:9; Ho 2:2,3; 3:4; 4:15-17; 9:15-17 and given her. De 24:1; Isa 50:1 feared not. 2Ki 17:19; Eze 23:11-21; Ho 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-9","title":"Jeremiah 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>lightness. or, fame. Eze 23:10 she defiled. 2; 2:7 committed. 2:27; 10:8; Isa 57:6; Eze 16:17; Ho 4:12; Hab 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-10","title":"Jeremiah 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Judah. 2Ch 34:33; 35:1-18; Ps 78:36,37; Isa 10:6; Ho 7:14 feignedly. Heb. in falsehood. Ps 18:44; 66:3; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-11","title":"Jeremiah 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>The backsliding. 8,22; Ho 4:16; 11:7 justified. Eze 16:47,51,52; 23:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-12","title":"Jeremiah 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>toward the north. 18; 23:8; 31:8; 2Ki 15:29; 17:6,23; 18:1 Return. 1,7,22; 4:1; Isa 44:22; Eze 33:11; Ho 6:1; 14:1-3 and I will not. 30:11; 33:26; Eze 39:25; Ho 11:8,9 for I am. 31:20; De 4:29-31; 2Ch 30:9; Ps 86:5,15; 103:8,17; 145:8 Mic 7:18-20; Ro 5:20,21 I will. 5; Ps 79:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-13","title":"Jeremiah 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>acknowledge. 25; 31:18-20; Le 26:40-42; De 30:1-3; Job 33:27,28; Pr 28:13 Lu 15:18-21; 1Jo 1:8-10 and hast scattered. 2,6; 2:20,25; Eze 16:15,24,25 under every. De 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-14","title":"Jeremiah 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>O backsliding. 2:19 for I am married. 1,8; 2:2; 31:32; Isa 54:5; Ho 2:19,20 one of a city. 23:3; 31:8-10; Isa 1:9; 6:13; 10:22; 11:11,12; 17:6; 24:13-15 Eze 34:11-14; Zec 13:7-9; Ro 9:27; 11:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-15","title":"Jeremiah 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>And I. 23:4; 1Sa 13:14; Isa 30:20,21; Eze 34:23; 37:24; Mic 5:4,5 Joh 10:1-5; 21:15-17; Eph 4:11,12; 1Pe 5:1-4 which shall. Pr 10:21; Lu 12:42; Joh 21:15,17; Ac 20:28; 1Co 2:6,12,13; 3:1,2 Heb 5:12-14; 1Pe 2:2; 5:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-16","title":"Jeremiah 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>when. 30:19; 31:8,27; Isa 60:22; 61:4; Eze 36:8-12; 37:26; Ho 1:10,11 Am 9:9,14,15; Zec 8:4,5; 10:7-9 say. 7:4; Zep 3:11; Mt 3:9 The ark. Isa 65:17; 66:1,2; Mt 1:11; Joh 4:20-24; Heb 9:9-12; 10:8,9,19-21 to mind. Heb. upon the heart. that be done. or, it bemagnified.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-17","title":"Jeremiah 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the throne. 14:21; 17:12; 31:23; Ps 87:3; Isa 6:1; 66:1; Eze 1:26; 43:7; Ga 4:26 and all the nations. Isa 2:2-4; 49:18-23; 60:3-9; 66:20; Mic 4:1-5; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23 to the name. Isa 26:8; 56:6; 59:19 walk. 7:24; 9:14; 11:8; 16:12; 18:12; Ge 8:21; Nu 15:39; Ro 1:21; 6:14 2Co 10:4,5; Eph 4:17-19 imagination. or, stubbornness. De 29:29; *marg: Jud 2:19; Ps 78:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-18","title":"Jeremiah 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>In. 30:3; 50:4,20; Isa 11:11-13; Eze 37:16-22; 39:25-28; Ho 1:11; 11:12 Zec 10:6 with. or, to. out. 12; 23:8; 31:8; Am 9:15 given, etc. or, caused your fathers to possess.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-19","title":"Jeremiah 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>How. 5:7; Ho 11:8 put thee. 4; 31:9,20; Joh 1:11-13; 2Co 6:17,18; Ga 3:26; 4:5-7; Eph 1:5 1Jo 3:1-3 pleasant land. Heb. land of desire. 12:10; Ps 106:24; Eze 20:6; Da 8:9; 11:16,41,45 goodly heritage. Heb. heritage of glory, or beauty. Pr 3:35; 1Pe 1:3,4 Thou shalt. 4; Isa 63:16; 64:8; Mt 6:8,9; Ro 8:15-17; Ga 4:5 shalt not. 32:39,40; Heb 10:39 from me. Heb. from after me.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-20","title":"Jeremiah 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>husband. Heb. friend. Ho 3:1 so have. 1,2,8-10; 5:11; Isa 48:8; Eze 16:15-52; Ho 5:7; 6:7; Mal 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-21","title":"Jeremiah 3:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>A voice. 30:15-17; 31:9,18-20; 50:4,5; Isa 15:2; Eze 7:16; Zec 12:10-14 2Co 7:10 for they have. Nu 22:32; Job 33:27; Pr 10:9; 19:3; Mic 3:9 and they have. 2:32; Isa 17:10; Eze 23:35; Ho 8:14; 13:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-22","title":"Jeremiah 3:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Return. Ho 6:1; 14:1,4 we. 31:18; Isa 27:8; So 1:4; Ho 3:5; 6:1,2; 13:4; 14:8; Zec 13:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-23","title":"Jeremiah 3:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>in vain. 6; 10:14-16; Ps 121:1,2; Isa 44:9; 45:20; 46:7,8; Eze 20:28 Jon 2:8,9 in the Lord. 14:8; Ps 3:8; 37:39,40; 121:1,2; Isa 12:2; 43:11; 45:15,17; 63:1,16 Ho 1:7; Joh 4:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-24","title":"Jeremiah 3:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>11:13; Eze 16:61,63; Ho 2:8; 9:10; 10:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-3-25","title":"Jeremiah 3:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>lie down. 2:26; 6:26; Ezr 9:6-15; Ps 109:29; Isa 50:11; La 5:16; Eze 7:18 Da 12:2; Ro 6:21 for we have sinned. 2:17,19; De 31:17,18; Ezr 9:6; Eze 36:32 we and our. 2:2; Ezr 9:7; Ne 9:32-34; Ps 106:7; Isa 48:8; La 5:7; Da 9:6-9 and have not. 22:21; Jud 2:2; Pr 5:13; Da 9:10</p>"}]}